---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Chapter Leadership
eyebrow: Leadership
intro: Officers, directors, and chairmen serving the Southern California Chapter.
permalink: /leadership/
---
<section><p class="eyebrow">Chapter officers</p><h2>Officers</h2><dl class="directory">{% for person in leadership.officers %}<div class="person"><dt>{{ person.role }}</dt><dd>{{ person.name }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}</dl></section>
{% for group in leadership.groups %}<section class="leadership-group" id="{{ group.name | slugify }}"><p class="eyebrow">Directors and chairmen</p><h2>{{ group.name }}</h2><dl class="directory">{% for person in group.members %}<div class="person"><dt>{{ person.role }}</dt><dd>{{ person.name }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}</dl></section>{% endfor %}
<section><div class="empty-state"><h2>Past Chapter Presidents</h2><p>The Chapter’s historical roster is being prepared for publication.</p></div></section>
